格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"pollyreach-dsh-plugin is a phone communication plugin built for DeepSeek Harness (dsh). Powered by the Cordis plugin system, it gives DeepSeek AI agents a dedicated phone number and the ability to make outbound calls, receive incoming calls, retrieve call results, check balances,","id":"gh:1338267828","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"pollyreach-dsh-plugin","slug":"PollyReach/pollyreach-dsh-plugin","topics":["ai-agent","ai-agents","aiphone","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"pollyreach-dsh-plugin is a phone communication plugin built for DeepSeek Harness (dsh). Powered by t"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"he Cordis plugin system, it gives DeepSeek AI agents a dedicated phone number and the ability to mak"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"e outbound calls, receive incoming calls, retrieve call results, check balances,"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-pollyreach"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A distributable DeepSeek Harness bundle for PollyReach. It registers seven native model-callable too"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ls plus the PollyReach skill, and includes secure shell CLIs for manual use."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Included capabilities"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- Register and securely persist a PollyReach credential.\n- Complete account activation and retrieve "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"the assigned phone number.\n- Submit outbound phone tasks and poll for full results.\n- Check credit b"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"alance without treating a zero balance as an invalid token.\n- Retrieve unread incoming-call data wit"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"hout flattening the API response.\n- Update the inbound answering prompt."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- Node.js 22.19 or newer.\n- DeepSeek Harness `@deepseek-ai/dsh` developer preview compatible with `d"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"sh-tools 0.0.1-rc.1`.\n- `curl` and `jq` only if you use the optional shell scripts."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Install a local checkout into an existing profile:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Install a packed release:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"After publishing to npm, users can install it with:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Remove it with:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The bundle contributes `cordis.patch.yml`; users do not need to edit the generated profile manifest "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"e contributes `cordis.patch.yml`; users do not need to edit the generated profile manifest manually."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Native tools"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Tool | Purpose |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| `pollyreach_register` | Register and atomically save a new credential |\n| `pollyreach_activation_s"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"tatus` | Check/poll activation and save the assigned number |\n| `pollyreach_send_call` | Submit one "},{"id":"p20s3","text":"outbound task |\n| `pollyreach_query_call` | Poll for the actual outbound result |\n| `pollyreach_bala"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"nce` | Return the complete balance response |\n| `pollyreach_inbound_calls` | Return unread incoming-"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"call data |\n| `pollyreach_update_inbound_prompt` | Change incoming-call behavior |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The plugin also registers `SKILL.md` through `ctx.skills`, so the Harness skill catalog can load beh"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"avioral guidance on demand."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Override defaults in the profile's `cordis.patch.yml`. Patch rows replace the whole config object, s"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"o include every value you want to preserve:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"`source` defaults to `openclaw` because that is the current PollyReach device-registration API contr"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"act, even though the client runtime is DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Credential security"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The registration tool stores this shape at `~/.config/PollyReach/key.json`:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The directory is created with restrictive permissions and the file is atomically written with mode `"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"0600`. The token is intentionally omitted from the registration tool result. Never commit the real f"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"ile; `examples/key.example.json` contains placeholders only."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Optional shell CLI"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The scripts are useful for diagnostics outside the model tool pipeline:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"They read the same credential file automatically; tokens are never command-line arguments. Tests can"},{"id":"p33s2","text":" override endpoints and paths with `POLLYREACH_API_BASE_URL` and `POLLYREACH_CREDENTIALS_FILE`."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Validate and package"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"No real PollyReach account is required for tests; network calls are mocked. Before publishing, test "},{"id":"p36s2","text":"the packed tarball against a disposable dsh profile:"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Compatibility note"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"This package targets the current DeepSeek Harness developer preview (`@deepseek-ai/dsh` 0.1.0-rc.7 a"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"nd `@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools` 0.0.1-rc.1). Preview APIs may change; update and retest the pinned peer "},{"id":"p39s3","text":"version before publishing a new release."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
